# REVIEWED: f52da1b7f3a3458a
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:25
msgid ""
"\\1. Which :iati-reference:`transaction/transaction-type` are used in "
"summary tables?"
msgstr ""
"\\1. ¿Qué :iati-reference:`transaction/transaction-type` se utilizan en las "
"tablas resumen?"

# REVIEWED: c2840825ed461c18
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:26
msgid ""
"Spend data is the sum of expenditure and disbursements. If these are not "
"published, outgoing commitments will be used."
msgstr ""
"Los datos de gastos son la suma de gastos y desembolsos. Si no se publican, "
"se utilizarán los compromisos salientes."

# REVIEWED: 6d201545fab33258
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:27
msgid ""
"Total commitment is the sum of outgoing commitments. If these are not "
"published, expenditure and disbursements will be used."
msgstr ""
"El compromiso total es la suma de los compromisos salientes. Si no se "
"publican, se utilizarán los gastos y desembolsos."

# REVIEWED: 00d401a14013fd6e
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:28
msgid ""
"Budget is the sum of  :iati-reference:`budget/value`. If these are not "
"published, :iati-reference:`planned-disbursement/value` will be used."
msgstr ""
"El presupuesto es la suma de :iati-reference:`budget/value`. Si no se "
"publican, se utilizará :iati-reference:`planned-disbursement/value`."

# REVIEWED: 296f7fd128b0b77e
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:32
msgid "\\2. How is the data cleaned?"
msgstr "\\2. ¿Cómo se depuran los datos?"

# REVIEWED: d85563acff18ad41
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:33
msgid "To be updated following finalisation of new data policy."
msgstr "Se actualizará tras la finalización de la nueva política de datos."

# REVIEWED: b176a35cdea69490
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:37
msgid "\\3. How is data assigned to a specific year?"
msgstr "\\3. ¿Cómo se asignan los datos a un año concreto?"

# REVIEWED: f095322d1d42f346
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:38
msgid ""
"For transactions, using :iati-reference:`transaction/transaction-date`, else"
" :iati-reference:`transaction/value/@value-date`."
msgstr ""
"Para transacciones, utilizando :iati-reference:`transaction/transaction-"
"date`, en otros casos mediante :iati-reference:`transaction/value/@value-"
"date`."

# REVIEWED: 18b8d2e0ddbe860b
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:39
msgid "For budgets, using :iati-reference:`budget/period-end`."
msgstr ""
"Para los presupuestos, utilizando :iati-reference:`budget/period-end`."

# REVIEWED: 8a4ffceee3ca4775
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:43
msgid "\\4. How are exchange rates calculated?"
msgstr "\\4. ¿Cómo se calculan los tipos de cambio?"

# REVIEWED: bfe19207c874c9d5
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:44
msgid ""
"Exchange rates are taken from the `Freechange "
"<https://xriss.github.io/freechange-charts/>`_ application. Freechange uses "
"a number of sources for exchange rates, depending on data availability. "
"These are fully described in the `Freechange Github repository "
"<https://github.com/xriss/freechange?tab=readme-ov-file#sources>`_."
msgstr ""
"Los tipos de cambio proceden de la aplicación `Freechange "
"<https://xriss.github.io/freechange-charts/>`_. Freechange utiliza varias "
"fuentes para los tipos de cambio, en función de la disponibilidad de datos. "
"Se describen en detalle en el `repositorio Freechange de Github "
"<https://github.com/xriss/freechange?tab=readme-ov-file#sources>`_."

# REVIEWED: 0dc15c7803a64612
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:46
msgid ""
"For USD, GBP, EUR, and CAD, currency conversion is carried out when "
"transactions and budgets are imported into d-portal. The `value-date element"
" <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-standard/203/activity-standard/iati-"
"activities/iati-activity/transaction/value/>`_ is used as the exchange date."
msgstr ""
"Para USD, GBP, EUR y CAD, la conversión de divisas se lleva a cabo cuando "
"las transacciones y los presupuestos se importan en d-portal. El `elemento "
"value-date <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-standard/203/activity-"
"standard/iati-activities/iati-activity/transaction/value/>`_ se utiliza como"
" fecha de intercambio."

# REVIEWED: 6056dc5e36b2fc71
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:48
msgid ""
"For all other currencies, transactions and budgets are initially converted "
"into USD. They are then converted into the target currency using today's "
"exchange rate. These values are estimates, and will be less accurate for "
"older transactions."
msgstr ""
"Para todas las demás monedas, las transacciones y los presupuestos se "
"convierten inicialmente a USD. A continuación, se convierten a la moneda de "
"destino utilizando el tipo de cambio diario. Estos valores son estimaciones "
"y serán menos precisos para las transacciones más antiguas."

# REVIEWED: 06863af368656821
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:52
msgid ""
"\\5. Why is my organisation's data missing from a recipient country's "
"chart/table/map?"
msgstr ""
