"de un país receptor?"

# REVIEWED: 6268e0c024ce4642
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:53
msgid ""
"Charts need a transaction with a :iati-reference:`transaction/transaction-"
"date` in the relevant year, with a valid :iati-reference:`recipient-"
"country/@code` or :iati-reference:`sector/@code`."
msgstr ""
"Los gráficos necesitan una transacción con una :iati-"
"reference:`transaction/transaction-date` en el año correspondiente, con un "
":iati-reference:`recipient-country/@code` o :iati-reference:`sector/@code` "
"válido."

# REVIEWED: f49c4534c324060a
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:54
msgid ""
"Tables need a transaction with a :iati-reference:`transaction/transaction-"
"date` in the relevant year, with a valid :iati-reference:`recipient-"
"country/@code` or :iati-reference:`sector/@code`."
msgstr ""
"Las tablas necesitan una transacción con un :iati-"
"reference:`transaction/transaction-date` en el año correspondiente, con un "
":iati-reference:`recipient-country/@code` o :iati-reference:`sector/@code` "
"válido."

# REVIEWED: 1f88e031871e3b36
#: ../../technical_faq.rst:55
msgid ""
"Maps need transactions with a valid :iati-reference:`location/point/pos` and"
" :iati-reference:`recipient-country/@code`."
msgstr ""
"Los mapas necesitan transacciones con un :iati-"
"reference:`location/point/pos` y un :iati-reference:`recipient-"
"country/@code` válidos."

